1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:02,170
(Howard:)if my mom could've
arranged a carpool.

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:04,840
(Raj:)Oh, yeah?

3
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:06,960
(Raj:)Well, I've been taking
Pilates class at the rec center,

4
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:09,840
(Raj:)and my abs look like
sections of a Hershey bar.

5
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,880
(Howard:)Oh, yeah? Won't matter,
you're going down!

6
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:13,630
(Raj:)No, uh-uh, you're going down!

7
00:00:13,630 --> 00:00:15,660
(Howard:)If anybody's going to go down,
it's going to be you.

8
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:20,440
(Leonard:)Fellas. It's been 30 minutes.
Nobody's touched each other.

9
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,640
(Sheldon:)I'm glad you decided to reject
your animal hindbrain

10
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:28,280
(Sheldon:)and return to the
realm of pure intellect.

11
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,450
(Amy:)As am I.

12
00:00:32,650 --> 00:00:34,200
(Amy:)What are you doing?

13
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:36,370
(Amy:)An experiment.

14
00:00:37,700 --> 00:00:39,920
(Amy:)Nope. Nothing.
Never mind.

15
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:53,720
(Raj:)You realize you can't win.

16
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:56,530
(Howard:)I prefer to think
that I can't lose.

17
00:01:00,370 --> 00:01:01,430
(Raj:)You're wrong.

18
00:01:01,430 --> 00:01:02,670
(Raj:)It's only a matter of time

19
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:06,600
(Raj:)before you fall into
Rat-Man's rat trap.

20
00:01:06,610 --> 00:01:08,070
(Howard:)You pathetic fool!

21
00:01:08,070 --> 00:01:11,040
(Howard:)If there were a rat-catcher,
wouldn't it catch Rat-Man?

22
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:13,440
(Raj:)Just because I didn't
express myself well

23
00:01:13,450 --> 00:01:15,830
(Raj:)doesn't mean my
underlying point was invalid!

24
00:01:15,830 --> 00:01:17,630
(Raj:)You bloviating buffoon!

25
00:01:17,630 --> 00:01:20,120
(Howard:)You narcissistic nincompoop!

26
00:01:20,120 --> 00:01:21,790
(Raj:)You crimson coward!

27
00:01:21,790 --> 00:01:23,190
(Raj:)Oh, Leonard, wake up,

28
00:01:23,190 --> 00:01:25,020
(Raj:)you're missing some very
excellent superhero quips.

